<title>POLAND: Bourse suspends Espebepe trade May 16.</title>
<headline>Bourse suspends Espebepe trade May 16.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Warsaw Stock Exchange will suspend trade in ailing Polish construction firm Espebepe SA on May 16, when its creditors are expected to meet to decide on a possible debt-write-off deal, the bourse's president said.</p>
<p>&quot;The management of the Warsaw bourse suspends trade in Espebepe shares on May 16, 1997,&quot; Wieslaw Rozlucki told reporters.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
